ike they were custom made for me.<\/strong><\/p><p>I love them! They hug all sides of my feet and ankles super well. Supportive without being too compressive. <\/p>","author":"Cynthia L."}}},"block_order":["testimonial_maiRQe","testimonial_garjXy","testimonial_49Kzaq"],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"title":"The Reviews Are In","color_bg":"#ecf1f2","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#333333","color_star":"#ffdd00","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":false,"autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":6,"circle_images":false,"padding-top":0,"padding-bottom":0}},"rich_text_qKTte6":{"type":"rich-text","custom_css":["h2 {font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px;}"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"title":"Try the next generation of Pilates grip socks","text":"<p>The <strong>CoreGrip Pro<\/strong> socks go beyond standard Pilates grip socks, delivering superior structure, durability and lasting traction. With ergonomic grip zones and breathable stretch fabric, they give you the barefoot feel you love without the slipping, twisting or bunching that often comes with ordinary socks.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Superior grip<\/strong> for reformer, mat and studio floors<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Reinforced heel and arch<\/strong> for stability and control<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Breathable knit upper<\/strong> keeps feet cool and comfortable<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Machine-washable<\/strong> for easy care and long-term wear<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":false,"full_width":false,"color_bg":"#ffffff","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#333333","text-align":"text-left","padding-top":0,"padding-bottom":0}}},"order":["main","1641343919e110f66c","background_video_FFwFB4","rich_text_CgxfW4","multicolumn_FXiKRg","image_with_text_CdEU9G","rich_text_nA87HH","featured_collection_rjmJzD","testimonials_igdW8W","rich_text_qKTte6"]}